### Prometheus Base URL
@prometheus = http://localhost:9090
@api_base = http://localhost:8090

### ============================================
### FIBER APPS METRICS - Summary
### ============================================

### Get current Fiber app metrics summary (all apps)
GET {{api_base}}/metrics-summary

### ============================================
### KAFKA METRICS
### ============================================

### Kafka Broker Count - Total number of brokers online
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=count(kafka_server_brokerinfo_version)

### Kafka Consumer Lag - Measures how far behind consumers are
### Lower is better, 0 means consumer is caught up
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=sum(kafka_consumer_lag{topic!=""}) by (topic, group)

### Kafka Consumer Lag by Group - Consumer group lag details
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=kafka_consumer_lag{topic!=""} > 0

### Kafka Total Messages In (Rate) - Message throughput into broker (msgs/sec)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(kafka_server_brokertopicmetrics_messagesinpersec_count[1m])

### Kafka Total Bytes In (Rate) - Data throughput into broker (bytes/sec)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(kafka_server_brokertopicmetrics_bytesinpersec_count[1m])

### Kafka Total Bytes Out (Rate) - Data throughput out of broker (bytes/sec)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(kafka_server_brokertopicmetrics_bytesoutpersec_count[1m])

### Kafka Failed Producer Requests Rate - Failed send attempts (reqs/sec)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(kafka_server_delayedoperationpurgatory_purgatorysize[1m])

### Kafka Under-Replicated Partitions - Partitions with missing replicas
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=kafka_server_replicamanager_underreplicatedpartitions

### Kafka ISR (In-Sync Replicas) Shrink Rate
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(kafka_server_replicamanager_isrshrinks_total[1m])

### Kafka Replica Fetch Manager - Bytes/sec from replicas
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(kafka_server_replicafetchermanager_bytesinpersec_count[1m])

### ============================================
### MONGODB METRICS
### ============================================

### MongoDB Operations Per Second - Total ops/sec rate
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_op_counters_total[1m])

### MongoDB Read Operations Rate (ops/sec)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_op_counters_total{type="query"}[1m])

### MongoDB Write Operations Rate (ops/sec)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_op_counters_total{type=~"insert|update|delete"}[1m])

### MongoDB Command Execution Time (Query Latency) - Milliseconds
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=mongodb_op_counters_latency_avg_ms

### MongoDB Current Connections - Active client connections
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=mongodb_connections_current

### MongoDB Used Connections - In-use connections
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=mongodb_connections_active

### MongoDB Available Connections - Remaining capacity
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=mongodb_connections_available

### MongoDB Memory Used - Resident memory bytes
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=mongodb_process_resident_memory_bytes

### MongoDB Memory Virtual - Virtual memory usage
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=mongodb_process_virtual_memory_bytes

### MongoDB CPU Usage - CPU seconds (user + system)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_process_cpu_seconds_total[1m])

### MongoDB Replication Lag - Seconds behind primary (replica sets)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=mongodb_rs_members_optimedate_ms - ignoring(instance) group_left mongodb_rs_optimedate_ms

### MongoDB Network Bytes In (Rate) - Incoming bytes/sec
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_network_bytes_in_total[1m])

### MongoDB Network Bytes Out (Rate) - Outgoing bytes/sec
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_network_bytes_out_total[1m])

### MongoDB Page Faults - Memory page fault rate
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_extra_info_page_faults[1m])

### MongoDB Lock Acquisitions - Global lock acquisition time (microseconds)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_global_lock_acquisitions_total[1m])

### MongoDB Collection Size - Total data size (bytes)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=mongodb_collection_size_bytes

### MongoDB Index Count - Number of indexes per collection
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=mongodb_collection_indexes

### MongoDB Query Executor Stats - Documents scanned
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(mongodb_op_counters_scanned[1m])

### ============================================
### MINIO METRICS
### ============================================

### MinIO Total Storage Usage - Total bytes stored (bytes)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=minio_cluster_capacity_usable_total_bytes

### MinIO Total Available Storage - Free space (bytes)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=minio_cluster_capacity_usable_free_bytes

### MinIO Storage Usage Percentage - Used vs total (%)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=(1 - (minio_cluster_capacity_usable_free_bytes / minio_cluster_capacity_usable_total_bytes)) * 100

### MinIO Total Objects - Count of stored objects
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=minio_cluster_objects_total

### MinIO API Requests Per Second - Request rate
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(minio_s3_requests_total[1m])

### MinIO API Requests Duration - Request latency (milliseconds)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=minio_s3_requests_duration_ms_bucket

### MinIO GET Requests Rate (ops/sec)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(minio_s3_requests_total{method="GET"}[1m])

### MinIO PUT Requests Rate (ops/sec)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(minio_s3_requests_total{method="PUT"}[1m])

### MinIO DELETE Requests Rate (ops/sec)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(minio_s3_requests_total{method="DELETE"}[1m])

### MinIO Failed Requests - 4xx/5xx errors (ops/sec)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(minio_s3_requests_errors_total[1m])

### MinIO Bytes Uploaded (Rate) - Upload bandwidth (bytes/sec)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(minio_s3_tx_bytes_total[1m])

### MinIO Bytes Downloaded (Rate) - Download bandwidth (bytes/sec)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(minio_s3_rx_bytes_total[1m])

### MinIO Disk Free Space - Per disk available (bytes)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=minio_disk_free_bytes

### MinIO Disk Used Space - Per disk used (bytes)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=minio_disk_used_bytes

### MinIO IAM API Calls - Authentication/authorization ops (ops/sec)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(minio_iam_events_total[1m])

### MinIO Heal Operations - Object heal rate (ops/sec)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(minio_heal_objects_total[1m])

### MinIO Bucket Count - Number of buckets
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=minio_cluster_buckets_total

### ============================================
### COMBINED/AGGREGATED QUERIES
### ============================================

### System Throughput - All services combined (ops/sec)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(kafka_server_brokertopicmetrics_messagesinpersec_count[1m]) + rate(mongodb_op_counters_total[1m]) + rate(minio_s3_requests_total[1m])

### System Network Traffic - All services (bytes/sec)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(kafka_server_brokertopicmetrics_bytesinpersec_count[1m]) + rate(mongodb_network_bytes_in_total[1m]) + rate(minio_s3_rx_bytes_total[1m])

### System Error Rate - All services combined (errors/sec)
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=rate(kafka_server_delayedoperationpurgatory_purgatorysize[1m]) + rate(mongodb_op_counters_errors_total[1m]) + rate(minio_s3_requests_errors_total[1m])

### P95 Latency Across Services - 95th percentile response time
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=histogram_quantile(0.95, rate(minio_s3_requests_duration_ms_bucket[5m]))

### P99 Latency Across Services - 99th percentile response time  
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query?query=histogram_quantile(0.99, rate(minio_s3_requests_duration_ms_bucket[5m]))

### ============================================
### TIME SERIES RANGE QUERIES (for graphs)
### ============================================

### Kafka Consumer Lag Over 1 Hour
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query_range?query=kafka_consumer_lag&start=1200&step=60&end=2400

### MongoDB Ops/sec Over Time
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query_range?query=rate(mongodb_op_counters_total[1m])&start=1200&step=60&end=2400

### MinIO Request Rate Over Time
GET {{prometheus}}/api/v1/query_range?query=rate(minio_s3_requests_total[1m])&start=1200&step=60&end=2400

### ============================================
### USAGE INSTRUCTIONS
### ============================================
### 
### To use these queries:
### 1. Copy the URL after GET
### 2. Paste into browser or REST client
### 3. Or modify the parameters as needed
### 
### Query Parameters:
###   - query: PromQL query string (URL encoded)
###   - start: Start time (Unix timestamp, optional)
###   - end: End time (Unix timestamp, optional)
###   - step: Query resolution (seconds, optional)
###
### For better results, use Prometheus UI: http://localhost:9090/graph
